equence</article-title><source>Biochem Biophys Res Commun</source><year>1971</year><volume>43</volume><fpage>1334</fpage><lpage>9</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">4936338</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="CIT10"><label>10</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Furr</surname><given-names>BJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Pharmacology of the luteinising hormone-releasing hormone (LH-RH) analogue, Zoladex</article-title><source>Horm Res</source><year>1989</year><volume>32</volume><fpage>86</fpage><lpage>92</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2533160</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="CIT11"><label>11</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>von Minckwitz</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Graf</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Geberth</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Eiermann</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Jonat</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Conrad</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>CMF versus goserelin as adjuvant therapy for node-negative, hormone-receptor-positive breast cancer in premenopausal patients: A randomized trial (GABG trial IV-A-93)</article-title><source>Eur J Cancer</source><year>2006</year><volume>42</volume><fpage>1780</fpage><lpage>8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16765589</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="CIT12"><label>12</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Vegh</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Enriquez de Salamanca</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Prolactin, TNF alpha and nitric oxide expression in nitroso-N-methylurea-induced mammary tumours</article-title><so